{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth, 2147.</strong>\u00a0The planet is overpopulated and polluted. Billions of people live in poverty and unemployment. Only a select few the lucky winners of a lottery manage to secure jobs.\u00a0<strong>CONGRATULATIONS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612620/extras/mars_gif_01.gif?t=1745273440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have won the <strong>Galactic Labor Reserve</strong>\u00a0lottery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>XenoMining Inc.</strong>\u00a0is sending you to <strong>Planet PX-173</strong>, where you will work in the mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Contract duration:</strong>\u00a06 months</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Job description:</strong>\u00a0Mineral extraction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Payment:</strong>\u00a0Based on your mining performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612620/extras/mars_gif_02.gif?t=1745273440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exo Digger</strong>\u00a0is a relaxing mining simulator set on a distant planet. Dig deep, extract rare minerals, upgrade your equipment, and expand your inventory. Explore the depths, but beware some areas of the mines may be dangerous. Who knows what secrets this planet holds beneath its surface? Keep digging, and perhaps fortune will smile upon you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to a new world. Good luck!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612620?t=1745273440","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3612620?t=1745273440","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612620/cbccff04ac2d4c1a94921d087c16c9f09f178b13/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745273440","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612620/cbccff04ac2d4c1a94921d087c16c9f09f178b13/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745273440","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earth, 2147.</strong>\u00a0The planet is overpopulated and polluted. Billions of people live in poverty and unemployment. Only a select few the lucky winners of a lottery manage to secure jobs.\u00a0<strong>CONGRATULATIONS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612620/extras/mars_gif_01.gif?t=1745273440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have won the <strong>Galactic Labor Reserve</strong>\u00a0lottery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>XenoMining Inc.</strong>\u00a0is sending you to <strong>Planet PX-173</strong>, where you will work in the mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Contract duration:</strong>\u00a06 months</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Job description:</strong>\u00a0Mineral extraction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 <strong>Payment:</strong>\u00a0Based on your mining performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612620/extras/mars_gif_02.gif?t=1745273440\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exo Digger</strong>\u00a0is a relaxing mining simulator set on a distant planet. Dig deep, extract rare minerals, upgrade your equipment, and expand your inventory. Explore the depths, but beware some areas of the mines may be dangerous. Who knows what secrets this planet holds beneath its surface? Keep digging, and perhaps fortune will smile upon you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to a new world. Good luck!</strong></p>","developers":["TornaGames"